  "title": "Head of Data & AI Platforms",
  "raw_text": "Head of Data & AI Platforms\nMeridian Retail Group · Bengaluru · Full-time\nAbout the role\nWe are looking for a senior leader to own our data and AI platforms end to end: the data platform that feeds analytics and machine learning, the tooling that takes models to production, and the team that builds and runs them.\nExperience\nMinimum 12 years in data or software engineering, including at least 5 years leading engineering teams.\nEducation\nBachelor's degree in Computer Science, Engineering or a related field preferred. Equivalent experience is considered.\nMust-have skills\nData Engineering (batch and streaming pipelines, lakehouse or warehouse design)\nMachine Learning (taking models from prototype to production)\nMLOps (model deployment, monitoring, retraining, feature stores)\nCloud Architecture (AWS or Azure)\nGood to have\nDatabricks\nApache Spark\nPython\nData Governance\nKubernetes\nStakeholder Management\nNice to have\nAWS Certified Solutions Architect\nBudget ownership above ₹10 crore\nResponsibilities\nLead a team of 30+ data, ML and platform engineers\nOwn the architecture of the lakehouse and ML platform\nPut ML models into production and keep them healthy\nWork with business leaders to prioritise data and AI investments",
